WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:06.454
This is pi-account-guard. Rotate accounts freely, and never send a turn into the wrong zone.

2
00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:21.833
Many of us keep a work subscription and a personal one in the same pi. Here, pi is open in a personal repository, but the selected model charges the work account. The footer already warns about it.

3
00:00:22.443 --> 00:00:25.493
Let's ask for a summary of the garden beds.

4
00:00:26.224 --> 00:00:40.274
Before anything is sent, pi-account-guard checks the account against this place. The account, acme, is tagged work. This repository is personal. So the turn is blocked, and nothing reaches the work subscription.

5
00:00:40.884 --> 00:00:47.084
The fix is one keystroke away. The first choice switches to homelab, a personal account.

6
00:00:48.491 --> 00:00:53.091
The same prompt runs again on homelab, and the footer shows a match.

7
00:00:53.699 --> 00:01:01.024
Accounts start untagged. Let's switch to spare, an account the guard has never seen, and ask about watering.

8
00:01:01.764 --> 00:01:08.089
Before the turn goes, the guard asks which zones spare belongs to. Nothing is ticked for you.

9
00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:14.143
We tick personal. The turn goes at once, and the tag is saved for next time.

10
00:01:14.753 --> 00:01:25.303
Rotators and routers switch accounts on their own, sometimes in the middle of a turn. Let's start a longer answer, then switch to the work account while it streams.

11
00:01:33.312 --> 00:01:40.287
The guard catches the change and stops the turn at once. It is aborted, not finished on the work account.

12
00:01:40.897 --> 00:01:50.647
Once pi is idle, the account it was on comes first. There is no allow once here, because the aborted turn is gone. We switch back to spare.

13
00:01:53.466 --> 00:02:02.416
Finally, slash guard shows what the guard sees. This directory matches no place rule, so it falls to the default zone, personal.

14
00:02:03.024 --> 00:02:07.749
Spare is tagged personal, so it matches, and turns here go through.

15
00:02:08.354 --> 00:02:15.404
To install it, run the command on screen. Then try slash guard tour, or add your first place rule.
